<div class="flex_column av-ph7dip-d9aba001436bae3ce77874cc60e09078 av_one_full avia-builder-el-11 avia-builder-el-no-sibling first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-mevqym8d-b2b563cb1c33ef223accb1c441143cbf av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-12 el_before_av_heading avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Understanding Depression: What You Need to Know</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<div class="av-special-heading av-mevqze4c-9c40849997fa3605eff101a2729f1012 av-special-heading-h3 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-13 el_after_av_heading el_before_av_textblock av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">What Is Depression?</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mevqyu38-dc29af9bc8078a0bc336c6fb08a2fd48" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Depression is more than feeling sad or having a bad day. It’s a serious mental health disorder that can affect how you feel, think, and approach daily activities. Different from temporary sadness, the symptoms of depression may persist for weeks or months, impacting every aspect of your life.</p>
<p>This complex brain disorder involves changes in neurotransmitter levels—the chemical messengers that help your brain cells communicate. When these chemicals become imbalanced, it can lead to the persistent symptoms that define major depressive disorder.</p>
</div></section></div>
</div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div></div><div class="avia-section av-osm68h-a6791b4be0f73ff4192fceb740004786 main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-15 el_after_av_section el_before_av_layout_row avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_4"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1985"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column_table av-lynow1-daf12a00537e008843721d382d5b3e9a sc-av_one_full av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-lynow1-daf12a00537e008843721d382d5b3e9a av_one_full avia-builder-el-16 el_before_av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="av-special-heading av-lfvgr5-52b79f55fd5a02aa68ad4cd455804bcf av-special-heading-h3 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-17 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Common Signs and Symptoms</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-jqoymp-1a41a3c7245481d59633ac00523b96eb" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Depression manifests differently in each person, but common symptoms include:</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --><div class="flex_column_table av-hrny5t-8e399864829975a9a1128435d68e589f sc-av_one_fourth av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-hrny5t-8e399864829975a9a1128435d68e589f av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-19 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_fourth first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-mevr1bp7-6e61fc615fbc17501847b3fcb1e6f245 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-20 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Emotional</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mevr1hc1-fa55dee2f1388a0cb604a2958ccc50d1" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Persistent feelings of emptiness, hopelessness, sadness, or irritability</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-fidf81-05fa6984e7a0534c42a5ac1a8ff0acc6 av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-22 el_after_av_one_fourth el_before_av_one_fourth flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-mevr1o03-4fa5063b6d9b4b4af2f5a0949895bb00 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-23 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Physical</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mevr1tiu-49720db9fe6f5ef89f496cfee370eb8e" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Fatigue, sleep disturbances, appetite changes, and unexplained aches</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-e40sld-32b14ee4a775cb7f4616093377e2c2d1 av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-25 el_after_av_one_fourth el_before_av_one_fourth flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-mevr307v-91c22841b65348c0b542f76e272ccbf4 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-26 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Cognitive</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mevr368j-e0854b638b0eb2dd41e90899549cdae9" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Difficulty concentrating, making decisions, or remembering things</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-c1pwap-21e77c3d7648b9a543db3a3b232e713d av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-28 el_after_av_one_fourth el_before_av_one_full flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-mevr3d5v-7f2715c1115f6f7e7fe3a55c2bab0728 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-29 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Behavioral</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mevr3i7v-995ff609e4a322bc7fde40e7681c3bb4" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Loss of interest in activities once enjoyed, social withdrawal, or neglecting responsibilities</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --><div class="flex_column_table av-abbgdt-ff03a08f5c29e76089e01f3ab3e38a71 sc-av_one_full av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-abbgdt-ff03a08f5c29e76089e01f3ab3e38a71 av_one_full avia-builder-el-31 el_after_av_one_fourth avia-builder-el-last first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><section class="av_textblock_section av-mevr0xhj-f8a87b54f3d070cde8e62bdd77c91c5d" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>If you experience several of these symptoms most days for at least two weeks, it may indicate clinical depression requiring professional help.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
</div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="av-layout-grid-container av-92afwh-51b59d5c9025a417210ec81428a747d1 entry-content-wrapper main_color av-flex-cells avia-builder-el-33 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section grid-row-not-first container_wrap fullsize" id="av-layout-grid-1">
<div class="flex_cell av-7yhttt-42d3364526c30c4973628d0b26649e43 av-gridrow-cell av_one_half no_margin avia-builder-el-34 el_before_av_cell_one_half avia-builder-el-first content-align-top"><div class="flex_cell_inner">
<div class="flex_column av-6k5mmp-c704269958c05ab013a9ded06ef4f1ab av_one_full avia-builder-el-35 avia-builder-el-no-sibling mobile-text first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-mevr41vm-52ee1addf83d83d7cc29443f49b88984 av-special-heading-h3 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-36 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">What Causes Depression?</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mevr48y0-1d042c931a94964f44a3f6cc8b941c1b" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Depression rarely has a single cause. Instead, it typically results from a combination of factors or causes:</p>
<p><strong>Biological factors</strong> can include imbalanced brain chemistry, genetics, and hormonal changes. Research shows that depression can run in families, suggesting a genetic component.</p>
<p><strong>Psychological factors </strong>generally encompass a variety of personality traits such as low self-esteem, problems coping with stress, and negative thinking patterns.</p>
<p><strong>Environmental factors</strong> include traumatic life events, chronic stress, major life changes, certain medications, and <a href="drug-addiction-rehabilitation.php">substance abuse</a>.</p>
<p>Understanding these factors helps explain why depression affects people so differently and why personalized treatment approaches are crucial for recovery.</p>
</div></section></div></div></div><div class="flex_cell av-4cpz3l-9c29d44df55f46dd0070723740d56551 av-gridrow-cell av_one_half no_margin avia-builder-el-38 el_after_av_cell_one_half avia-builder-el-last content-align-top avia-full-stretch"><div class="flex_cell_inner">
<div class="hr av-3ak381-ff1915bd04b1389066cbea88be0869b1 hr-invisible avia-builder-el-39 avia-builder-el-no-sibling"><span class="hr-inner"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div>
</div></div>
</div>
<div class="avia-section av-g99cwh-2fd93983e49f5dd54d516c42524f554e main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-40 el_after_av_layout_row el_before_av_section avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_5"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-1985"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column_table av-e63629-2ee5ecb3476d5964e5812c9ccb8f7d06 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-e63629-2ee5ecb3476d5964e5812c9ccb8f7d06 av_one_half avia-builder-el-41 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-middle"><div class="avia-image-container av-mevta7e2-678c291acffd6d8159a348dbcb13f75f av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-42 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Depression therapy in Miami for treatment-resistant depression may include TMS, HBOT, IV nutrition, theta brainwave therapy and more." class="wp-image-2009 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-2009 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="398" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Casa-Privee-luxury-clinic-for-depression-care-in-Miami.webp" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Casa-Privee-luxury-clinic-for-depression-care-in-Miami.webp 576w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Casa-Privee-luxury-clinic-for-depression-care-in-Miami-300x207.webp 300w" title="Depression therapy in Miami for treatment-resistant depression may include TMS, HBOT, IV nutrition, theta brainwave therapy and more." width="576"/></div></div></div></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-cclwy9-c380977f0417e5dcf57a79ecfd5b3ad1 av_one_half avia-builder-el-43 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last mobile-text flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-middle"><div class="av-special-heading av-b882zl-361834bcb7b544cbb44075ae9c888c04 av-special-heading-h4 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-44 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Why Traditional Treatment Sometimes Falls Short</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-9q3kdt-87d9b39275fb772e5eb56d336a909491" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>Many people struggle with depression despite trying multiple medications and therapy approaches. Standard antidepressants work for some, but studies show that up to 30% of people don’t respond adequately to conventional treatments.</p>
<p>This is where treatment-resistant depression becomes a significant challenge. When first-line treatments fail, it doesn’t mean you’re untreatable—it means you need more advanced, targeted approaches that address the underlying neurological factors contributing to your condition.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
