<div class="av-special-heading av-mevsa0ih-db0f3e828e6231519675afd5177fdf95 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-68 el_after_av_heading el_before_av_textblock av-inherit-size av-linked-heading"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline"><a class="av-heading-link" href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">NeuroStar TMS Therapy </a></h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mevsaiq7-2d7d7108ada26510412dd76a6a7e9c4c" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p><a href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">Transcranial Magnetic Stimulation</a> uses magnetic pulses to stimulate underactive nerve cells in your brain’s mood-regulating regions. This non-invasive, FDA-approved treatment helps rebalance neurotransmitter levels and promotes neuroplasticity—your brain’s ability to form new, healthier neural pathways.</p>
<p>Unlike medications, TMS doesn’t cause systemic side effects like weight gain or sexual dysfunction. Most patients report significant improvement in symptoms, with many achieving complete remission.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Ready to discovery why TMS is the most advanced treatment-resistant depression therapy Miami has to offer, <a href="contact-us.php">reach out today</a>.</strong></em></p>
</div></section></div><div class="flex_column_table av-7obqtd-a4029651f56b9e319cf21d84cf71179b sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-7obqtd-a4029651f56b9e319cf21d84cf71179b av_one_half avia-builder-el-70 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top avia-full-stretch column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-mevsawpm-f99dc6073d90f5e5a58ab956f45b4c4d av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-71 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size av-linked-heading"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline"><a class="av-heading-link" href="hyperbaric-oxygen-therapy-hbot.php">Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy (HBOT)</a></h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-mevsb5jb-dac531b47aea71db52989c586e3d4c99" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p><a href="hyperbaric-oxygen-therapy-hbot.php">HBOT</a> delivers high concentrations of oxygen to your brain in a pressurized chamber. This process improves blood flow, reduces chronic inflammation linked to depression, and enhances your brain’s natural healing capacity. By increasing oxygen delivery and regulating inflammatory markers, HBOT helps restore balance to mood-regulating neurotransmitters.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-5ixtlt-59bedd9ea35b9398b778d4d747ce5c01 av_one_half avia-builder-el-73 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top avia-full-stretch column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-mevsbdjm-03829f382c12aa23804013b3ad528890 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-74 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">IV Nutritional Therapy</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
