<div class="togglecontainer av-mevszdd5-d3d49a83686216cb825bfaf8c113db7a av-minimal-toggle avia-builder-el-108 el_after_av_heading avia-builder-el-last toggle_close_all enable_toggles" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
<section class="av_toggle_section av-mevsy23l-0cd83540154139a5f4dec9f6d2bfb309" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.1. How long does treatment take?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.1. How long does treatment take?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.1. How long does treatment take?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-1" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.1. How long does treatment take?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-1" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.1. How long does treatment take?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-1" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-1" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>Treatment duration varies based on individual needs and chosen therapies. Our <a href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">TMS therapy in Miami</a> typically requires 4-6 weeks of daily sessions, while other treatments may show benefits more quickly. We’ll provide a personalized timeline during your consultation.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-mevsybow-5fed95482f833416bfe9d4941cb3aad9" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.2. Is treatment covered by insurance?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.2. Is treatment covered by insurance?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.2. Is treatment covered by insurance?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-2" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.2. Is treatment covered by insurance?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-2" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.2. Is treatment covered by insurance?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-2" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-2" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>Many of our treatments, including TMS, are covered by major insurance plans. Our team will verify your coverage and help navigate insurance requirements.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-mevsylyb-793b14c234406b9d4dc09622880eb7b3" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other treatment centers?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other treatment centers?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other treatment centers?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-3" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other treatment centers?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-3" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.3. What makes Casa Privée different from other treatment centers?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-3" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-3" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p><a href="our-approach.php">Our neuropsychiatric approach</a> combines advanced brain science with personalized medicine. We don’t just treat symptoms—we address underlying causes using cutting-edge technology and comprehensive assessment methods.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-mevsywln-542884d67ff25f0582610faabe92bbb6" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.4. Are there any side effects?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.4. Are there any side effects?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.4. Are there any side effects?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-4" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.4. Are there any side effects?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-4" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.4. Are there any side effects?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-4" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-4" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>Our treatments are generally well-tolerated with minimal side effects. Unlike many medications, treatments like TMS and <a href="hyperbaric-oxygen-therapy-hbot.php">Hyperbaric oxygen therapy</a> don’t cause systemic effects such as weight gain or sexual dysfunction.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-mevsz6i0-d10a322951ac33b0efaa8d75bbb15bea" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Q.5. How do I know if I’m a candidate for these treatments?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Q.5. How do I know if I’m a candidate for these treatments?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Q.5. How do I know if I’m a candidate for these treatments?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-5" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Q.5. How do I know if I’m a candidate for these treatments?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-5" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Q.5. How do I know if I’m a candidate for these treatments?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-5" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-5" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>We evaluate each patient individually. If traditional treatments haven’t provided adequate relief, or if you’re looking for non-medication alternatives, our advanced approaches may be excellent options for you.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
